  - lines:
    - 'need some advice? '
    - if you want to blast jump, fire your flame at your feet as you jump; it will
      propel you great distances!
    - 'wall jumps are a bit tricky, but you can scale great heights if done right.  '
    - you need to aim your shots very low to the wall as you move directly into it,
    - staying close the wall to get blasted upward.
    - 'pogo''s are jumps where your feet never touch the ground. '
    - they are brutal to get right , but pogo's can generate great speed and allow
      traversal of dangerous terrain.
    - 'just make sure to aim more and more forward as you gain speed. '
    - are you writing this down?
